OL,3,GNEWSAMore Brighton traffic cameras as
OL,4,Asigns 'ignored'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTraffic enforcement cameras will be
OL,7,Finstalled at five sites in Brighton
OL,8,Fwhere motorists are "blatantly
OL,9,Fignoring" signs, a councillor has said.
OL,11,FThe new cameras at locations in central
OL,12,FBrighton, Hollingbury and Rottingdean
OL,13,Fhad community support, said Brighton
OL,14,Fand Hove City Council's lead member for
OL,15,Ftransport and city infrastructure.
OL,17,FTrevor Muten said: "This is not blanket
OL,18,Fenforcement but targeted protection.
OL,19,FNot success measured by tickets issued
OL,20,Fbut by behaviour changed."
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
