OL,5,
OL,6,FThe estimated cost of installing
OL,7,Fcameras at all five sites is #94,000,
OL,8,Ffunded by the authority's CCTV camera
OL,9,Fcapital programme, according to the
OL,10,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service.
